    <item>
      <headword id="idp118791728">feothaich</headword>
      <description>semi-conscious. Bha e ’na shìneadh fuar, feothaich. (A common expression on Scalpay. I am not sure of the word being recorded in a dictionary.) [SLIP: Semi-conscious. Common on Scalpay.]</description>
